        "content": "\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #181B1F 0%, #1e2228 100%); padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 4px solid #3274D9; margin-bottom: 4px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">\n  <div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #FFFFFF; letter-spacing: 0.3px;\">Batch Ingestion & SLA Health Operations</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8E8E93; margin-top: 2px;\"><b>Primary Decision:</b> Monitor pipeline runtime, loaded volume, and exception rates across 7 Excel/CSV sources &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Audience:</b> Data Engineering & SRE &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Coverage:</b> 2023\u20132026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Auto-Refresh:</b> 1m</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\">\n    <a href=\"/d/bi-channel-margin/channel-revenue-and-margin\" style=\"background: #22262E; color: #61AFFE; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; border: 1px solid #3274D9;\">\ud83d\udcca Channel Margin</a>\n    <a href=\"/d/bi-hospital-forecast/hospital-forecast-vs-actual\" style=\"background: #22262E; color: #49DA9A; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; border: 1px solid #299C46;\">\ud83c\udfe5 Hospital Demand</a>\n    <a href=\"/d/bi-fast-slow/fast-vs-slow-movers\" style=\"background: #22262E; color: #FADE2A; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; border: 1px solid #EAB839;\">\u26a1 Fast / Slow</a>\n    <a href=\"/d/batch-ingestion/batch-ingestion-operations\" style=\"background: #22262E; color: #B3BAC5; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; border: 1px solid #3A3F4B;\">\ud83d\udce6 Batch DE</a>\n    <a href=\"/d/streaming-ingestion/streaming-ingestion-operations\" style=\"background: #22262E; color: #B3BAC5; padding